---
import ExamLayout from '../layouts/ExamLayout.astro';
---

<ExamLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms governing the use of ExamStatus, an independent government exam tracking dashboard."
>
  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4 mb-2">1. Informational purpose only</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      ExamStatus is an independent, unofficial dashboard that aggregates publicly available information about
      government exams, admit cards, and results. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official
      channel of UPSC, SSC, any Railway Recruitment Board, IBPS, any State Public Service Commission, or any
      other recruiting authority. This site does not constitute a legal document.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Accuracy of information</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      We make reasonable efforts to keep dates, vacancy counts, and eligibility details accurate and current,
      but errors and delays can happen. Always verify final details — especially closing dates and eligibility
      — on the official recruiting authority's website or notification before making any decision or payment.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">3. External links</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      "Apply Online," "Official Website," and "Notification PDF" links lead to external, official sources. We
      are not responsible for the content, availability, or practices of those external sites.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">4. No liability</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      We are not liable for any loss, missed deadline, or damage arising from reliance on information found on
      this site. Use of this site is at your own discretion.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">5. Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      These terms may be updated periodically as the site evolves. Continued use of the site after changes
      means you accept the updated terms.
    </p>
  </div>
</ExamLayout>
